{%- doc -%}
  The Boot Match mark: a flame with a football in front of it, made from two Google Material
  Symbols (local_fire_department, filled, and sports_soccer). The flame is drawn in fire colours;
  the ball is white with dark panels.

  @param {string} id - A unique id for the flame's gradient (more than one mark can be on a page)
  @param {string} [class] - Classes for the svg
{%- enddoc -%}
